#: ../../tools/gtex_v2_tools.rst:32 76eeac83afcd497698c0e4c33ac38fb1
msgid ""
"**Description**: Calculate custom eQTL for any gene-variant pair in any "
"tissue. Dynamically calculates gene-variant association statistics "
"including p-value, normalized effect size (NES), t-statistic, and "
"genotype data. Works for both significant and non-significant "
"associations. Returns detailed statistics even if association not in "
"precomputed results. Use for: testing specific hypotheses, custom "
"variant-gene pairs, dynamic eQTL analysis, validating findings. Requires "
"all three: gencode\\_id, variant\\_id, and tissue\\_site\\_detail\\_id."
msgstr ""

